msgctxt "84_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey, you got a second? Are you Miki Nishihama-san's friend?"
msgstr "Perdona, ¿tienes un minuto? ¿Eres la amiga de Miki Nishihama?"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Miki's Friend
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "96_Miki's Friend"
msgid "Yes, I am. Who are you?"
msgstr "Así es. ¿Quién es usted?"

msgctxt "108_Akiyama"
msgid "Er, well... I know her father, you see, and I could've\\r\n"
"sworn I heard you say he \"fooled\" someone... What's that\\r\n"
"about?"
msgstr "Eh... Conozco a su padre. Me pareció oír que el papá de\\r\n"
"Miki \"engañó\" a alguien... ¿A qué te refieres?"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Miki's Friend
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "120_Miki's Friend"
msgid "Oh... Well, I dunno if I should say, but..."
msgstr "Oh... Pues no sé si deba contar algo, pero..."

msgctxt "132_Miki's Friend"
msgid "There's this, like, urban legend, y'know? About a legendary\\r\n"
"loan shark who gives out money for free right here in\\r\n"
"Kamurocho."
msgstr "He oído que en Kamurocho hay un prestamista que\\r\n"
"otorga préstamos sin pedir nada a cambio."

msgctxt "144_Miki's Friend"
msgid "I mean, he'll kill you if you don't pay up, but, like, if\\r\n"
"you manage to really pull the wool over his eyes, you can\\r\n"
"get by without paying a single yen."
msgstr "Si no cumples con el pago, hay consecuencias graves,\\r\n"
"pero si logras engañarlo, podrías evitar cualquier pago."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "156_Akiyama"
msgid "Huh... A \"legendary loan shark,\" you say?"
msgstr "Mmm... Un \"famoso prestamista\", eh."

msgctxt "168_Miki's Friend"
msgid "Word is: Miki's dad totally fooled this guy and made off\\r\n"
"with a buttload of cash. Maybe, like, two hundred million or\\r\n"
"something..."
msgstr "Se dice que el padre de Miki logró engañar a esta persona\\r\n"
"y se llevó consigo una gran cantidad de dinero, alrededor de\\r\n"
"doscientos millones de yenes..."

msgctxt "180_Miki's Friend"
msgid "But, like, Mr. Nishihama has his own company and stuff, so I\\r\n"
"thought for sure it was just a rumor..."
msgstr "Pero, dado que el señor Nishihama tiene su propia empresa,\\r\n"
"pensé que era simplemente un rumor..."

msgctxt "192_Miki's Friend"
msgid "Then again, she started buying all these brand-name clothes\\r\n"
"and, like, a bunch of jewelry, so maybe it's true after all!"
msgstr "Por otro lado, empezó a comprar todas estas prendas de marca\\r\n"
"y, además, mucha joyería, así que puede que sea cierto después de todo."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "204_Akiyama"
msgid "Hmm... I see. Thanks. I think I get it now."
msgstr "Mmm... Ya veo. Gracias. Creo que ya lo tengo."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "228_Akiyama"
msgid "(Well, they're not exactly trying to cover it up... Fancy clothes and jewelry in Kamurocho? Must be Le Marche... I should go check it out.)"
msgstr "(Parece que no les importa disimular... ¿Ropa y joyas de lujo en Kamurocho? Debe ser Le Marche... Debería ir a echar un vistazo)."
